# Shell scripts, nginx configs and Dockerfiles are executed on Linux. A CRLF
# copy of a shell script fails there with `\r: command not found`, so pin the
# line endings in the repo regardless of the committer's platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

*.xlsx binary
*.ico  binary
